\[ D = \sec^2 x (\cos^2 x \cot^2 x - \csc^2 x \cos^2 x) - (\cos^2 x \cot^2 x - \csc^2 x) + (\cos^4 x - \cos^2 x) \]
\[ D = \sec^2 x \cos^2 x (\cot^2 x - \csc^2 x) - \cos^2 x \cot^2 x + \csc^2 x + \cos^4 x - \cos^2 x \]
We know that $\cot^2 x - \csc^2 x = \cot^2 x - (1+\cot^2 x) = -1$.
\[ D = \sec^2 x \cos^2 x (-1) - \cos^2 x \cot^2 x + \csc^2 x + \cos^4 x - \cos^2 x \]
\[ D = -\sec^2 x \cos^2 x - \cos^2 x \cot^2 x + \csc^2 x + \cos^4 x - \cos^2 x \]
Since $\sec^2 x = 1 + \tan^2 x = 1 + \frac{\sin^2 x}{\cos^2 x}$, we have
