\text{Given $|z|=5$, we want to find $|\overline{z}^2|$.}
Since $|z|=5$, we have $|z|^2=25$.  We have $\overline{z} = \frac{1}{z}$, so $\overline{z}^2 = \frac{1}{z^2}$.  Therefore, $|\overline{z}^2| = \left|\frac{1}{z^2}\right| = \frac{1}{|z^2|} = \frac{1}{25}$.

