\begin{enumerate}
    \item Convert $8888_{10}$ to base 8.
    \item Find the sum of the digits of the base 8 representation.
\end{enumerate}

Let's convert $8888_{10}$ to base 8. We repeatedly divide by 8 and keep track of the remainders:
\begin{align*} 8888 \div 8 &= 1111 \text{ remainder } 0 \\ 1111 \div 8 &= 138 \text{ remainder } 7 \\ 138 \div 8 &= 17 \text{ remainder } 2 \\ 17 \div 8 &= 2 \text{ remainder } 1 \\ 2 \div 8 &= 0 \text{ remainder } 2 \end{align*}
Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we have $8888_{10} = 21270_8$.

Now we find the sum of the digits of the base 8 representation $21270_8$:
$$2 + 1 + 2 + 7 + 0 = 12$$

